# Deterministic native menu-input probe derived from Dessyreqt's 2014 bot.
# Addresses are WRAM offsets (7E:xxxx -> xxxx).
#
# This diagnostic deliberately stops at the main menu. It establishes whether
# SNESRecomp's scripted controller pulses are sampled by Uniracers before the
# full race route is restored.

turbo on

# Dessyreqt: menu.mainMenu = 215 = 0xD7.
until 009F == D7 3600
dump main-menu

# The recovered bot treats selectedOption 0 as the desired 1P entry and uses
# Up/Down to navigate this menu. Probe directions first so A is not ambiguous.
press down 2
wait 30
dump after-main-down

press up 2
wait 30
dump after-main-up

# Try confirmation with a two-frame pulse. If this changes currentMenu, the
# earlier one-frame pulse was too narrow for this native sampling path.
press a 2
wait 60
dump after-main-a

quit
